sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title JRN-003 SAR Filing — Happy Path (Automated Trigger to NCA Submission)

    participant EB as SVC-102 Event Bus
    participant KYC as SVC-014 KYC/AML
    participant CC as SVC-015 Compliance Core
    participant MLRO as PER-052 MLRO
    participant RB as SVC-001 Retail Banking
    participant AL as SVC-103 Audit & Logging
    participant NCA as NCA SAR Online

    rect rgb(245, 245, 255)
        Note over EB,KYC: SAR-PH-001 — Suspicion Trigger
        EB->>KYC: SanctionsHitDetected (EVT-006) consumed
        Note right of KYC: trigger_type=automated_event
        KYC->>KYC: Create SARInvestigationRecord (ENT-009)<br/>status=open
        KYC->>EB: Publish SARInvestigationOpened (EVT-014)
        EB->>AL: SARInvestigationOpened → WORM audit log
        KYC->>CC: MLRO case management alert (secure internal)
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
        Note over MLRO,KYC: SAR-PH-002 — MLRO Investigation
        MLRO->>CC: Open investigation [step-up MFA]
        CC->>KYC: GET /investigations/{id}
        KYC-->>CC: SARInvestigationRecord
        CC->>KYC: GET /kyc/assessments/customer/{customer_id}
        KYC-->>CC: KycAssessment (ENT-003)
        CC->>RB: GET /accounts/{id}/transactions
        RB-->>CC: Transaction history
        MLRO->>CC: Add evidence items
        CC->>KYC: POST /investigations/{id}/evidence (×N)
        Note right of KYC: WORM — immutable after addition
    end

    rect rgb(255, 255, 240)
        Note over MLRO,KYC: SAR-PH-003 — SAR Decision
        MLRO->>CC: Record decision: file_sar + rationale (≥200 chars)
        CC->>KYC: POST /sars (CreateSARRequest)
        Note right of KYC: ENT-008 created<br/>status=draft<br/>SLA clock starts
        KYC->>EB: Publish SARDecisionMade (EVT-015)
        EB->>AL: SARDecisionMade → WORM audit log
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over MLRO,KYC: SAR-PH-004 — SAR Preparation
        MLRO->>CC: Complete NCA SAR form fields
        CC->>KYC: PATCH /sars/{id} (investigation_summary, transactions, accounts)
        MLRO->>CC: Confirm tipping-off review ✓ and mark ready
        CC->>KYC: PATCH /sars/{id} status=ready_for_submission
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over MLRO,NCA: SAR-PH-005 — SAR Submission
        MLRO->>CC: Trigger SAR submission
        CC->>KYC: POST /sars/{id}/submit
        Note right of KYC: tipping_off_review_confirmed=true required
        KYC->>NCA: POST SAR payload (NCA SAR Online API)
        Note over KYC,NCA: Retry up to 3× with exponential backoff
        NCA-->>KYC: 200 OK + nca_reference
        Note right of KYC: filed_date recorded<br/>status=filed<br/>sla_status computed
        KYC->>EB: Publish SARFiled (EVT-016)
        Note right of EB: MINIMAL PAYLOAD ONLY:<br/>customer_id + restriction_required<br/>NO nca_reference, NO narrative
        EB->>RB: SARFiled consumed [restriction_required=true]
        EB->>AL: SARFiled → WORM audit log
        KYC-->>CC: SARSubmissionResponse (sar_id, nca_reference, filed_date, sla_status=within_sla)
        CC-->>MLRO: Submission confirmed — NCA ref displayed
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over RB,EB: SAR-PH-006 — Post-Filing Actions
        RB->>RB: Apply enhanced_monitoring_flag to accounts
        Note right of RB: No customer notification with SAR reference
        RB->>EB: Publish AccountRestrictionApplied (EVT-019)
        MLRO->>CC: Close investigation
        CC->>KYC: PATCH /investigations/{id} status=closed
    end

    Note over MLRO,NCA: TIPPING-OFF CONTROLS:<br/>1. Customer (PER-001) receives NO notification at any stage<br/>2. SARFiled payload carries no SAR detail to SVC-001<br/>3. Account restriction shown to customer as generic "under review"
